sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Build CLI (build-lesson-packs.ts)
  participant P as protect.ts + sanitize.ts
  participant S as Static Bundles (frontend/packs & GET /v1/lesson-packs/:lang)
  participant SW as Service Worker (sw.js) + IndexedDB (idb.js)
  participant L as Learner PWA (100% Offline)

  Note over B,P: Build / CI Time (Zero live CPU/GPU inference at runtime)
  B->>P: Read master lessons from data/exercises.json
  Note over P: sanitize() + protect() lock Excel formulas (=SUM, =B2*B3*B4) and Python syntax
  P-->>B: Syntax-verified text across all 11 official SA languages
  B->>S: Write versioned JSON packs (en, zu, xh, af, nso, tn, st, ts, ss, ve, nr) + manifest.json

  Note over SW,L: Learner Runtime (Instant, Offline-First)
  L->>SW: Select language (e.g. isiZulu / Sepedi / Afrikaans)
  alt Pack already in IndexedDB or SW cache
    SW-->>L: Serve verified JSON pack immediately (0 network calls, 0 LLM calls)
  else First fetch of language pack while online
    SW->>S: GET /packs/{lang}.json (or /v1/lesson-packs/{lang})
    S-->>SW: 200 OK (Cache-Control + ETag)
    SW->>SW: Store in stepstack-packs-v1 + IndexedDB packs store
    SW-->>L: Render localized lessons offline thereafter
  end
